$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: Typical Procedure for the Synthesis of 4aa A
magnetic stirring bar, 1a (240.8 mg, 1.0 mmol), 2a (150.5 mg, 1.5 mmol),
3 (302.1 mg, 1.2 mmol), PdCl2 (9.0 mg, 0.05 mmol), LiCl (8.9 mg, 0.2
mmol), Et3N (151.0 mg, 1.5 mmol), and C6H6 (10 mL) were placed in Pyrex
vial under Ar. Then, t-BuNC (23 µL, 0.2 mmol) was added. The solution was
irradiated with Solarbox (Xe, 1000 W/m2) with violently stirring for 16
h. The reaction mixture filtered and concentrated in vacuo to give a
residue, which was subjected to silica gel column chromatography using
hexane/EtOAc = 50/1 as eluent, 4aa (131.0 mg, 0.71 mmol, 71%). ethyl
3-cyclohexylpropanoate (4aa)2 ethyl 9-((4-bromobenzyl)oxy)nonanoate (4ia)
Colorless oil (170.9 mg, 0.46 mmol, 46%). 1H-NMR (CDCl3, 400 MHz) δ
7.47-7.44 (m, 2H), 7.22-7.20 (m, 2H), 4.43 (s, 2H), 4.12 (q, J = 7.2 Hz,
2H), 3.44 (t, J = 6.6 Hz, 2H), 2.30-2.26 (m, 2H), 1.63-1.57 (m, 4H),
1.37-1.23 (m, 11H); 13C-NMR (CDCl3, 100 MHz) δ 173.84, 137.69, 131.39,
129.17, 121.23, 72.04, 70.12, 34.32, 29.65, 29.21, 29.15, 29.02, 26.07,
24.90, 14.22; IR (neat) 2931 cm-1, 2856 cm-1, 1731 cm-1, 1387 cm-1, 1180
cm-1, 1098 cm-1, 1031 cm-1, 1011 cm-1, 803 cm-1; MS (relative intensity)
m/z 291 ([M-Br]+, 34), 185 (50), 171 (97), 169 (100), 139 (64), 101 (35);
HRMS (ESI) m/z calcd for C18H27 79BrO3Na 393.1036, found 393.1302.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM chemoselective, photochemical, regioselective, tin-free Giese reaction,
Solarbox used
